WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.752 --> 00:00:02.419
I’m ready.

00:00:06.173 --> 00:00:06.965
Amber?

00:00:06.965 --> 00:00:09.301
♪♪

00:00:09.301 --> 00:00:11.303
Bambi:
If you’re out there and you’re
listening,

00:00:11.303 --> 00:00:16.099
♪♪

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:17.559
Bambi:
we’re all so worried about you.

00:00:17.559 --> 00:00:18.894
♪♪

00:00:18.894 --> 00:00:19.728
(Gunfire)

00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:20.604
(Screaming)

00:00:20.604 --> 00:00:21.688
♪♪

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:22.856
You did nothing wrong.

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:24.650
♪♪

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:26.276
Bambi:
We're gonna find a way out of
this.

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:30.656
♪♪

00:00:30.656 --> 00:00:32.032
I can’t let her die.

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:33.325
Prince:
I’m not gonna let her die.

00:00:33.325 --> 00:00:36.453
♪♪

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:41.375
My name is Amber Chesborough and
I’m being held against my will
in Venezuela.

00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:44.044
♪♪

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:44.920
Amber:
You want answers.

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:47.214
She’s his wife, she’s my sister.

00:00:47.214 --> 00:00:48.048
Bambi:
We’re desperate for something.

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:49.633
♪♪

00:00:49.633 --> 00:00:52.135
You better go down there.
Take care of your sister.

00:00:52.678 --> 00:00:53.845
We don’t need money.

00:00:53.845 --> 00:00:55.597
This is political stuff, don’t
worry about it.

00:00:55.597 --> 00:00:57.224
♪♪

00:00:57.224 --> 00:00:59.434
My brother and my husband are in
special forces.

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:01.103
(Guns cocking and gunfire)

00:01:01.103 --> 00:01:02.646
♪♪

00:01:02.646 --> 00:01:04.273
I know how these decisions are
made.

00:01:04.273 --> 00:01:05.399
Prince:
They won’t approve a raid.

00:01:05.399 --> 00:01:07.109
♪♪

00:01:07.109 --> 00:01:08.193
Prince:
We have to get her out.

00:01:08.193 --> 00:01:08.735
♪♪

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:11.113
(Guns cocking)

00:01:11.113 --> 00:01:12.739
I guess we should cancel dinner.

00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:13.740
♪♪

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:18.203
How many lives are you willing
to trade for your sister?

00:01:18.203 --> 00:01:19.454
♪♪

00:01:19.454 --> 00:01:20.998
Natalie:
The CIA wants a war

00:01:20.998 --> 00:01:22.249
Natalie:
and you’re gonna give it to
them.

00:01:22.249 --> 00:01:22.666
(Click)

00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:26.503
Al Qaeda Commander:
The truth is democracy is dead
in North America.

00:01:26.503 --> 00:01:28.964
We reject your influence.

00:01:28.964 --> 00:01:30.382
(Gunfire)

00:01:31.383 --> 00:01:33.260
Don’t fantasize of a rescue.

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:34.678
Journalist:
They can’t find this place.

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:40.600
You don’t know my family.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:46.857
♪♪

